                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "667c3201-a70c-3ba3-b485-cf52b78eea2f",
                        "entry_id": "ee600423-d5f4-34bb-96c2-679e59d8a56b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An early type of firearm, using a spring-loaded flint to strike sparks into the firing pan."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc08208c-197a-41be-b2f5-73906b36bf98",
                                "sense_id": "667c3201-a70c-3ba3-b485-cf52b78eea2f",
                                "text": "But then I had the flintlock by me for protection. ¶ There were giants in the days when that gun was made; for surely no modern mortal could have held that mass of metal steady to his shoulder. The linen-press and a chest on the top of it formed, however, a very good gun-carriage; and, thus mounted, aim could be taken out of the window,[…]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d08ace89-afd9-3011-8013-433e7850f594",
                        "entry_id": "ee600423-d5f4-34bb-96c2-679e59d8a56b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of lock used on muskets, rifles, and pistols from the early 17th to the mid-19th century."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
